WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.570
- My husband's still
looking forward to it.

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:02.470
We have a three year old,

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.450
and he's still looking forward to it.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.283
- Oh.
- Like he's like

00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:07.500
"It's gonna be so exciting."
- Three is a wonderful age.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.390
- They are, it is a threenager though,

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.331
but yeah, he's our boy.
- He's a threenager?

00:00:11.331 --> 00:00:13.570
- Twos were fine, threes are

00:00:14.952 --> 00:00:17.461
the devil has actually
come inside their body,

00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:18.294
(audience laughing)

00:00:18.294 --> 00:00:19.901
- And I need an exorcist.
- So you're drinking communion

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:22.368
every night?
- I drink a lot of communion.

00:00:22.368 --> 00:00:23.700
(laughing)

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.660
I just, it wasn't my fault.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.170
Jesus changed that water into wine.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.100
He taught us correctly.
- That's right.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.731
- Yes, I don't need water.

00:00:29.731 --> 00:00:32.040
Are you bothering them to
have grandkids yet though,

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.070
because now they're out of the house?

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.480
- Oh yes, in fact I do it nationally.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.360
Like every talk show I go on.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.010
Okay, what camera should I look in?

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:39.860
This one right here, okay.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.260
Boys, just letting you know.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:45.872
The first one that gives me
a grandchild gets the house.

00:00:45.872 --> 00:00:47.032
(audience yelling)

00:00:47.032 --> 00:00:52.005
- Oh my gosh!
(audience applause)

